{"id":"chatcmpl-4619a86b-29ea-417c-a35f-ad9100dcbf4c","object":"chat.completion","created":1792701061,"model":"qwen3.8-flash-next-atlas","system_fingerprint":"fp_atlas","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"The user is asking for ten practical tips for reducing household energy use, each with a one-sentence reason. This is a straightforward informational request. I'll provide clear, actionable tips with concise explanations.\n","content":"# Ten Practical Tips for Reducing Household Energy Use\n\n1. **Switch to LED light bulbs.** They use up to 75% less energy than incandescent bulbs and last significantly longer.\n\n2. **Unplug electronics when not in use.** Many devices continue drawing \"phantom\" power even when turned off, adding up to 10% of your electricity bill.\n\n3. **Set your water heater to 120°F (49°C).** This temperature is sufficient for most household needs and reduces standby heat loss.\n\n4. **Use a programmable or smart thermostat.** It automatically adjusts heating and cooling based on your schedule, preventing wasted energy when you're away or asleep.\n\n5. **Seal air leaks around doors and windows.** Drafts force your heating and cooling systems to work harder to maintain a comfortable temperature.\n\n6. **Wash clothes in cold water.** Heating water accounts for about 90% of the energy used by a washing machine.\n\n7. **Clean or replace HVAC filters monthly.** Clogged filters restrict airflow, making your system consume more energy to circulate air.\n\n8. **Run dishwashers and washing machines only with full loads.** This maximizes the energy and water used per item cleaned.\n\n9. **Install low-flow showerheads and faucet aerators.** They reduce hot water"},"finish_reason":"length","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":4482,"completion_tokens":320,"total_tokens":4802,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480,"audio_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":40,"audio_tokens":0,"accepted_prediction_tokens":205,"rejected_prediction_tokens":0},"time_to_first_token_ms":153.956077,"response_token/s":35.66025605466782}}